  "notes": "Drawn from one right-side photo of 767-300 N269CM (November 2025). Right-side photo only; the left side is assumed to mirror it. Re-checked 2026-11-15 with left (N237CM 2024-10-11) and right (N349CM 2023-01-17, N432AX 2023-06-25) photos: the star-A is the A of AMERIJET, so it sits ahead of MERIJET on the left and aft of it on the right, with INTERNATIONAL under the name's end as read; each side now has its own title pair and star (the right had shown the star forward and INTERNATIONAL aft). Right side: MERIJET x 0.124-0.264, INTERNATIONAL 0.124-0.201, star centred at 0.284.",
